@host = http://localhost:5000

### Ca 1: GET / - Kiểm tra trạng thái máy chủ
GET {{host}}/

### Ca 2: GET /api/assignments - Lấy danh sách bài tập
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### Ca 3: POST /api/assignments/1/submissions - Tạo lượt nộp bài hợp lệ (201 + Location, status = received)
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### Ca 4: GET /api/submissions/{id} - Đọc lại trạng thái lượt nộp (received -> processing -> graded)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### Ca 5: POST /api/assignments/1/submissions - Thiếu dữ liệu (400 Bad Request)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### Ca 6: POST /api/assignments/999/submissions - Nộp bài không tồn tại (404 Not Found)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### Ca 7: GET /api/submissions/{id_rong_hoac_khong_ton_tai} - Đọc ID không tồn tại (404 Not Found)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Ca 8: POST /hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1 - Bắt tay SignalR (200 OK + connectionId)
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### Ca 9: POST /hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1 - Sai đường dẫn hub (404 Not Found)
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

